msgid "Implementing a custom Stork service registrar"
msgstr ""

msgid "This guide explains how to implement a custom service registrar for https://smallrye.io/smallrye-stork[SmallRye Stork] and use it to programmatically register service instances at startup."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are new to Stork, please read the xref:stork.adoc[Stork Getting Started Guide]."
msgstr "Stork を初めて使用する場合は、xref:stork.adoc[Stork 入門ガイド] をお読みください。"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "この技術は、{extension-status}と考えられています。"

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "_preview_ では、下位互換性やエコシステムでの存在は保証されていません。具体的な改善には設定や API の変更が必要になるかもしれませんが、 _stable_ になるための計画は現在進行中です。フィードバックは link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] や link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub の課題管理] で受け付けています。"

msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "とりうるステータスの完全なリストについては、 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#extension-status[FAQの項目] を参照してください。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "このガイドを完了するには、以下が必要です。"

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "約15分"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "IDE"

msgid "JDK 17+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "JDK 17+がインストールされ、 `JAVA_HOME` が適切に設定されていること"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "使用したい場合は、 link:cli-tooling.html[Quarkus CLI]"

msgid "Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr "ネイティブ実行可能ファイルをビルドしたい場合、MandrelまたはGraalVM（あるいはネイティブなコンテナビルドを使用する場合はDocker）をインストールし、 link:building-native-image.html#configuring-graalvm[適切に設定]していること"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "アーキテクチャ"

msgid "In this guide, we will build an application that:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Implements a custom service registrar by extending Stork's SPI"
msgstr ""

msgid "Programmatically registers a service instance at startup"
msgstr ""

msgid "Configures the registrar via `application.properties`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Beyond service discovery and load balancing, it also supports xref:stork-registration.adoc[_service registration_].\n"
"Service registration is the process of announcing a service instance to a registry so that other services can discover it.\n"
"While Stork provides built-in registrars for Consul, Eureka, and others, you can implement your own by using the Stork SPI."
msgstr ""

msgid "Solution"
msgstr "ソリューション"

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the completed example."
msgstr "次の章で紹介する手順に沿って、ステップを踏んでアプリを作成することをお勧めします。ただし、完成した例にそのまま進んでも構いません。"

msgid "Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr "`git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}` で Git リポジトリーをクローンします。または、{quickstarts-archive-url}[アーカイブ] をダウンロードします。"

msgid "The solution is located in the `stork-programmatic-custom-registration-quickstart` link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/stork-programmatic-custom-registration-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bootstrapping the project"
msgstr "プロジェクトのブートストラップ"

msgid "Create a Quarkus project importing the quarkus-rest, quarkus-smallrye-stork, and quarkus-rest-client-jackson extensions using your favorite approach:"
msgstr ""

msgid "CLI"
msgstr "コマンドラインインタフェース"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "Gradleプロジェクトを作成するには、 `--gradle` または `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` オプションを追加します。"

msgid "For more information about how to install and use the Quarkus CLI, see the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] guide."
msgstr "Quarkus CLIのインストールと使用方法の詳細については、 xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] ガイドを参照してください。"

msgid "Maven"
msgstr "Maven"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `-DbuildTool=gradle` or `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "Gradleプロジェクトを作成するには、 `-DbuildTool=gradle` または `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` オプションを追加します。"

msgid "For Windows users:"
msgstr "Windowsユーザーの場合:"

msgid "If using cmd, (don't use backward slash `\\` and put everything on the same line)"
msgstr "cmdを使用する場合、（バックスラッシュ `\\` を使用せず、すべてを同じ行に書かないでください）。"

msgid "If using Powershell, wrap `-D` parameters in double quotes e.g. `\"-DprojectArtifactId={create-app-artifact-id}\"`"
msgstr "Powershellを使用する場合は、 `-D` パラメータを二重引用符で囲んでください。例: `\"-DprojectArtifactId={create-app-artifact-id}\"`"

msgid "In the generated project, also add the following dependencies:"
msgstr "生成されたプロジェクトに、以下の依存関係を追加します:"

msgid ""
"`stork-core` provides the Stork API and SPI needed to implement a custom registrar.\n"
"`stork-configuration-generator` generates configuration classes at build time based on annotations on your registrar provider."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Custom Service Registrar Provider"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Stork uses a provider model.\n"
"To create a custom registrar, you need two classes:"
msgstr ""

msgid "A *provider* implementing `ServiceRegistrarProvider` — the factory that creates registrar instances."
msgstr ""

msgid "A *registrar* implementing `ServiceRegistrar` — the actual registration logic."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Let's start with the provider.\n"
"Create the `src/main/java/org/acme/services/CustomServiceRegistrarProvider.java` file with the following content:"
msgstr ""

msgid "There are a few important things to note:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `@ServiceRegistrarType` annotation declares the registrar _type_.\n"
"This is the value used in the `quarkus.stork.<service-name>.service-registrar.type` property.\n"
"Here, it is `custom`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `@ServiceRegistrarAttribute` annotations declare the configuration attributes for this registrar.\n"
"Stork's annotation processor (provided by `stork-configuration-generator`) uses these annotations to generate\n"
"the `CustomRegistrarConfiguration` class at compile time. You do not need to write this class yourself."
msgstr ""

msgid "The `@ApplicationScoped` annotation makes this provider a CDI bean, so Stork can discover it automatically."
msgstr ""

msgid "The `createServiceRegistrar` method is the factory that creates a `CustomServiceRegistrar` from the generated configuration."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Custom Service Registrar"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Now let's implement the registrar itself.\n"
"Create the `src/main/java/org/acme/services/CustomServiceRegistrar.java` file with the following content:"
msgstr ""

msgid "This registrar:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Receives its configuration (host and port) from the generated `CustomRegistrarConfiguration` class."
msgstr ""

msgid "Stores registered instances in a `ConcurrentHashMap`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Implements `registerServiceInstance` to add a service instance to the map."
msgstr ""

msgid "Implements `deregisterServiceInstance` to remove a service instance on shutdown."
msgstr ""

msgid "Both methods return `Uni<Void>`, since Stork uses Mutiny for reactive support."
msgstr ""

msgid "Programmatic Service Registration at Startup"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With the registrar in place, we can now register service instances programmatically.\n"
"Create the `src/main/java/org/acme/services/Registration.java` file with the following content:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When the application starts, this CDI bean observes the `StartupEvent` and uses the Stork API to register a service instance.\n"
"The `Stork.getInstance().getService(\"my-service\")` call retrieves the Stork service named `my-service`, and `registerInstance`\n"
"delegates to the custom registrar we created earlier."
msgstr ""

msgid "Stork configuration"
msgstr "Stork の設定"

msgid "Now we need to configure Stork to use our custom registrar."
msgstr ""

msgid "In the `src/main/resources/application.properties`, add:"
msgstr "`src/main/resources/application.properties` に以下を追加します:"

msgid ""
"The `quarkus.stork.my-service.service-registrar.type` property tells Stork to use the `custom` registrar type.\n"
"This matches the value declared in the `@ServiceRegistrarType` annotation on `CustomServiceRegistrarProvider`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `quarkus.stork.my-service.service-registrar.host` property maps to the `host` attribute declared with `@ServiceRegistrarAttribute` on the provider.\n"
"This is a required attribute."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can optionally set `quarkus.stork.my-service.service-registrar.port` as well, since the provider declares an optional `port` attribute.\n"
"If omitted, the registrar defaults to port `8080`."
msgstr ""

